  "note": "Triennial election of the Ballymena Urban Council, January 1929. Market Ward was uncontested after Mr. William Cameron's withdrawal; Town Hall and Harryville Ward were contested. 1,212 of 1,600 voters polled (75.7 per cent); 7 spoiled papers. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026)."
